<div class="quiz-question"><p>5. כמה כוכביות יודפסו: for i=1 to 3: for j=1 to 2: print(*)?</p><div class="quiz-options"><label class="quiz-option"><input type="radio" name="q5" value="A"> A — 5</label><label class="quiz-option"><input type="radio" name="q5" value="B"> B — 6</label><label class="quiz-option"><input type="radio" name="q5" value="C"> C — 9</label></div></div>

        <button class="quiz-btn" onclick="showScore()">בדקי תשובות ✨</button>
        <div class="quiz-score" id="score"></div>
    </div>
